      en: ["The highest point is Loma del Curro at 1,343 meters", "Declared a National Park in 1996", "Geologically classified as an isolated tectonic horst", "Home to over 100 endemic plant species", "Critical habitat for iguanas and rare cacti species", "Acts as a natural barrier to the prevailing trade winds"],
